Changelog: 14-11-2026 03:27:00

Breaking. Windows support is removed: the suite is for Bazzite. run.ps1 and install.ps1 are gone, an app of dev/
starts with its run.sh alone, and Test local apps starts every window as python -m with this venv (no run.ps1 of a
suite's portal or app). The tours are recorded with setsid and stopped by their process group, as they always were
on Linux. Nothing changes on Linux.

Changelog: 14-11-2026 01:05:10

Fixed. The tests, their fixture and the examples no longer name the suite for Windows devices (owner, 14-11-2026):
the second suite in the tests is "ws", with ws- tags and a windows_portal package. Nothing works differently.
